d Stambler hires a  local man Emmett to wit to help him  build a bunker under his farmhouse in  rural Louisiana the film never gives a  definitive year but around 2014 a young  girl named Brittany goes missing a  couple years later a man in a woman  named Michelle who will learn more about  soon pieced together that Howard  actually abducted Brittany and forced  her to live in the bunker this is made  clear when Michelle finds the word help  scratched  skylight at some point Howard killed  Brittany presumably because she was  attempting to escape this brings us to  the harrowing story of Michelle after a  bad breakup she leaves New Orleans and  is driving near Lake Charles Louisiana  where she's in a car accident  she later wakes up in the underground  bunker of an extremely strange man  Howard informs Michelle that there's  been an attack of some kind which has  contaminated the air and is preventing  them from leaving the shelter she soon  meets Emmett who also witnessed some  version of the attack before heading for  the bunker and the two share of  suspicions about Howard weeks pass and  the trio seems to relax into some sense  of normality  despite Howard's angry demeanor and  paranoia everything changes when  Michelle crawls into the ventilation  system and discovers Britney's help  message together she and Emmett make a  plan to escape the bunker by  constructing hazmat suits out of  anything that can find Howard ultimately  discovers that Emmett took a pair of  scissors as part of this effort and  threatens both of them with a barrel of  perchloric acid Emmett quickly claims  that he was the only one stealing things  and apologizes unfortunately Howard  hasn't really mastered the art of  conflict resolution I accept your  apology desperate to escape the bunker  Michelle tries to secretly finish the  hazmat suit only to be discovered by  Howard in the struggle to escape  Michelle kicks over the barrel of acid  towards Howard he's badly burned and the  acid reaches a lamp Court which starts a  fire that spreads throughout the bunker  Michelle crawls through the ventilation  system and ultimately escapes to a car  abandoned by Leslie a woman who visited  the bunker earlier but was not allowed  in due to lesions all over her skin  Howard is presumably killed when the  bunker explodes as she prepares to leave  the farm Michelle sees an alien  spacecraft in the sky over the fields a  creature detaches from the ship and  pursues her she eventually takes shelter  in Howard's truck as the tentacle tries  to grab her she fights back by crafting  an improvised Molotov cocktail setting  the ship on fire and causing it to fly  away Michelle finally drives away and  tunes into an emergency radio broadcast  which tells survivors to meet in Baton  Rouge however anyone with military or  medical experience should head to  Houston to join the fight to retake the  southern seaboard from the  Asia she turns the car around and drives  toward Houston the Cloverfield paradox  takes place in 2028 when the earth is  rapidly running out of energy as fuel  and electricity is rationed people have  resorted to using dangerous devices to  siphon power the governments of the  world unite for one final plan to save  humanity  the Cloverfield station a spacecraft  built by a coalition of global agencies  that will activate the shepard particle  accelerator  if the shepard works it will provide  earth with an unlimited new supply of  energy among the scientists chosen for  the mission is ava Hamilton a  communications officer who lost her  children in a house fire caused by a  device she was using to siphon power  there are those who are not convinced  that the Sheppard is the best way  forward some propose that activating the  accelerator could trigger something  dubbed the Cloverfield paradox this  would open doorways to other universes  which could then lead to all manner of  terrifying alien life attacking earth  eagle-eyed viewers will notice that 